<p style="color:#1e293b;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;margin:0;">The first byte selects the width; multi-byte values are little-endian.</p>
</div>
<p style="font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;">Write <strong><code>read_varint(data)</code></strong> that returns the integer value encoded at the start of the <code>bytes</code> object <code>data</code>.</p>
